{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('snapshot_apply_explore_test.go');s=p.read_text();old=''' // Stop before choosing whether to apply or discard snapshot-covered work.\n // That caller contract remains the subject of investigation.\n''';new=''' // Conditional continuation: follow the acquired interaction apply worker,\n // which applies each queued configuration entry without a coverage filter.\n // This does not decide whether that policy is owed by a production caller.\n assuranceEvent(map[string]interface{}{\\\"event\\\":\\\"before_old_application\\\",\\\"config\\\":follower.rn.raft.trk.ConfState(),\\\"applied\\\":follower.rn.BasicStatus().Applied})\n c.holdApply=0\n c.drain(0)\n assuranceEvent(map[string]interface{}{\\\"event\\\":\\\"after_old_application\\\",\\\"config\\\":follower.rn.raft.trk.ConfState(),\\\"applied\\\":follower.rn.BasicStatus().Applied,\\\"remaining_apply_batches\\\":len(follower.applyQ),\\\"snapshot_config\\\":stored.Metadata.ConfState})\n'''\nassert old in s;s=s.replace(old,new);Path('snapshot_apply_policy_explore_test.go').write_text(s)\nimport json\ns=dict(action='explore',question='Under the in-repository interaction worker policy of applying every queued configuration entry, what happens to the actual restored membership when the already reached snapshot-covered batch is finally processed?',rationale='Reconsider the rejected completion decision by measuring a narrower conditional consumer effect. This exploration does not invent a normative oracle or decide caller-policy applicability.',harness_path='snapshot_apply_policy_explore_test.go',files={},sources=[dict(id='storage-message-response-contract',file='raftpb/raft.proto',start_line=102,end_line=108,kind='interface_statement')],feedback=dict(ref_ids=['1da528d106ac41228ed922e9d0f6aa2a','interaction-apply-worker','interaction-append-worker','config-activate','storage-message-response-contract'],answered='Stop preflight rejected bounded completion because unresolved scope remains. Recomparison identifies a useful conditional discriminator: the reached prefix can continue using the already acquired interaction worker policy, revealing whether replay of the queued entry actually changes restored membership or is absorbed by configuration-change protections. The newly read message response contract requires work completion but adds no snapshot-covered entry reconciliation rule. The new driver preserves the same producer history and records ConfState before and after processing the old batch, plus the snapshot ConfState and remaining queue count.',remaining=['Execution must establish the actual effect of this conditional continuation.','Whether this policy is required or permitted for a production embedding remains unresolved; no equality obligation or consensus violation is asserted by this exploration.'],understanding='unchanged',rationale='Actual consumer effects can narrow the consequence of the known contract gap even when they cannot resolve applicability. This is more informative than repeating reachability or merely changing the rejected stop label.'))\njson.dump(s,open('submission.json','w'),indent=2)\nPY\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-02_10-41-34-etcd_raft-real-run --submission submission.json\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
